{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午9時許，油麻地彌敦道192號地下一間餐廳廚房起火，冒出大量濃煙。</p><p>警方接獲多人報案，消防接報到場將火撲熄。</p><p>事件中，餐廳顧客及約20名職員自行疏散到安全位置，無人受傷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:22:01.998124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:52:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.324755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:18:12.773102+00:00","content_hash":"64496646e49ffcf6e891fbaa589e2f9dfa1bcebacc5ca8b58c366b666b1aa53d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}